@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}
<div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4">
    <h2 class="fw-bold text-railway-blue mb-3">About Vietnam Railway Ticket Sales System</h2>
    <p class="lead">
        This web application is an end-to-end Railway Ticket Sales System designed and developed in accordance with the project User Requirement Document (URD) and Analysis Modeling Document (SWD).
    </p>
    <h5>Supported Core Workflows:</h5>
    <ul>
        <li>Search Train Schedules & Real-time Seat Availability</li>
        <li>10-Minute Hold Reservation Mechanism (Server-side enforced)</li>
        <li>Mock Payment Gateway integration (Online Banking, Cards)</li>
        <li>Electronic Ticket issuance with 2D QR Code validation and print functionality</li>
        <li>Ticket Change workflow with fare difference recalculation</li>
        <li>Ticket Cancellation & Automated Refund processing (BR-07, BR-09, BR-10)</li>
        <li>Ticket Clerk Counter Booking and cash confirmation interface</li>
        <li>Administrator Portal with Train, Station, Route, Schedule, Coach, Seat, Fare, and User CRUD, plus Analytics Reports</li>
    </ul>
</div>
